{%- comment -%}
  Right-panel grid of sub-collection circles (mega menu "state 1" — before
  a specific sub-collection has been hovered).
  params: sub_collections (array of Collection, from the parent's
  metafields.custom.sub_collections)
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="mega-menu__grid">
  {%- for sub in sub_collections -%}
    <a href="{{ sub.url }}" class="mega-menu__sub-item" data-mega-sub-trigger data-panel="sub-{{ forloop.index0 }}">
      <span class="mega-menu__sub-thumb">
        {%- comment -%} A collection with no image of its own used to drop straight to
          the placeholder sketch, which is how the Jacquards circle sat empty until
          its image was set. Falling back to the first product's photo means a newly
          created collection looks right immediately, and the placeholder is only
          reached when the collection has no products either. Same fallback order
          the left-hand category thumbs in mega-menu.liquid already use. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if sub.image -%}
          <img src="{{ sub.image | image_url: width: 120 }}" alt="{{ sub.title | escape }}" width="60" height="60" loading="lazy">
        {%- elsif sub.products.first.featured_image != blank -%}
          <img src="{{ sub.products.first.featured_image | image_url: width: 120 }}" alt="{{ sub.title | escape }}" width="60" height="60" loading="lazy">
        {%- else -%}
          {{ 'collection-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
      <span class="mega-menu__sub-label">{{ sub.title }}</span>
    </a>
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>
